{"id": null, "n": "0750002", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0750002", "type": "orig", "text": "它集作時"}
{"id": null, "n": "0750003", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0750003", "type": "orig", "text": "吉凶集作凶吉"}
{"id": null, "n": "0750004", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0750004", "type": "orig", "text": "實下集有投子拈云然諸佛不出世亦無有涅槃佛既如是道亦如然是以從上諸聖密證此地所以然燈不付正覺自成法既無傳至今續㷔法既無得更復何談罔測稱揚虛談互說然到此地者何必塔前相見對眾拈華截臂傳衣方為道矣既不如是因甚大庾嶺頭提不起之文"}
{"id": null, "n": "0750005", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0750005", "type": "orig", "text": "證所集作所證"}
{"id": null, "n": "0750006", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0750006", "type": "orig", "text": "事作旨"}
{"id": null, "n": "0750007", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0750007", "type": "orig", "text": "林集作休"}
{"id": null, "n": "0750008", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0750008", "type": "orig", "text": "投子下集有二問二答"}
{"id": null, "n": "0750009", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0750009", "type": "orig", "text": "峯下集有前字"}
{"id": null, "n": "0750010", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0750010", "type": "orig", "text": "蕉下集有示眾二句"}
{"id": null, "n": "0750011", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0750011", "type": "orig", "text": "慮集作見"}
{"id": null, "n": "0750012", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0750012", "type": "orig", "text": "鎮集作振"}
